#. module: account_budget_oca
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:account_budget_oca.act_crossovered_budget_view
msgid ""
"A budget is a forecast of your company's income and/or expenses\n"
"                expected for a period in the future. A budget is defined on some\n"
"                financial accounts and/or analytic accounts (that may represent\n"
"                projects, departments, categories of products, etc.)"
msgstr ""
"Enpresan etorkizuneko epe jakin batean espero diren diru-sarrera\n"
"                eta gastuen aurreikuspenak dira aurrekontuak. Besteak beste,\n"
"                proiektuak, sailak eta produktuen kategoriak adierazten dituzten\n"
"                finantza-kontu eta/edo kontu analitiko batzuetan definitzen dira."

